challenge.summary='A competitive challenge platform connecting trivia, real-time rounds, host-created battles, and participant progression.';
challenge.challenge='Keeping rounds fair when answers arrive together, rejecting duplicate submissions, finalizing winners consistently, and distributing payouts correctly.';
challenge.approach='The backend includes regression tests for concurrent duplicate answers, paid joins, round reveal behavior, winner limits, and payout distribution, alongside load-ramp scripts.';
challenge.result='A connected challenge frontend and backend with explicit checks for the edge cases that can undermine a competitive experience.';
